    "Read all 42 complete literals, full proposed replacements and relevant full account/agreement, pricing, market and notification page context at the frozen revision, including imported notification-channel snippet.",
    "Current Setup View Hosting Agreement and market Location Map labels are correctly reflected; Account > Settings is retained as current individual-account navigation. Team visibility or delivery is not generalized from that account.",
