    "Two income examples explicitly assume constant price, utilization and 720 hours. Products of population statistics are not promoted as measured host earnings; arithmetic and rounding independently checked.",
    "Installer source was inspected through install_version and main, including replacement of the managed environment. No execution, platform success, package version or backend state is inferred.",
    "Original notification product-guide provenance predates this project. Event definitions and current names are source/UI reviewed; uplift, consequence and rentability claims are removed where evidence does not support them.",
    "Low-disk replacement is cautious operational advice to inspect storage before cleanup, not a claimed execution or a promise that cleanup is universally safe.",
